      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "As a zeroth order optimizer, MBD is capable of addressing both trajectory optimization and broader,",
      "bbox": [
        107.64099884033203,
        352.8233642578125,
        505.2394104003906,
        361.72991943359375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "high-dimensional unconstrained optimization challenges. Such black-box optimization tasks are",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        363.73236083984375,
        503.99737548828125,
        372.638916015625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "universally acknowledged as difficult [7, 63]. We first show superior performance of MBD within",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        374.641357421875,
        503.9950866699219,
        383.54791259765625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "this black-box optimization context. In such settings, the Bayesian Optimization technique struggles",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        385.55035400390625,
        503.9985046386719,
        394.4569091796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "due to the computational intensity required to develop surrogate models and identify new potential",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        396.4593505859375,
        503.9989318847656,
        405.36590576171875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "solutions [18]. Alternative black-box optimization strategies [23] are not limited by computational",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
